{"seq":2,"slug":"swr-vercel-patterns","title":"SWR 模式与最佳实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-data-fetching-patterns/libraries/swr-vercel-patterns","wordCount":996,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"swr-模式与最佳实践\">SWR 模式与最佳实践</h1><p>SWR 由 Vercel 团队开发，其名称直接源于 HTTP 缓存策略 <code>stale-while-revalidate</code>（RFC 5861）。相比 TanStack Query 的&quot;功能全面&quot;路线，SWR 选择了极简主义——用最小的 API 表面积覆盖 80% 的数据请求场景。在 Next.js 生态中，SWR 是天然的首选方案。当前稳定版为 v2.4.x，最新 beta（v2.5.0-beta）引入了 <code>unload()</code> API 用于主动清除缓存。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>Key 即参数</strong>：缓存键同时作为 fetcher 的输入参数，将&quot;描述要什么数据&quot;与&quot;如何获取数据&quot;自然绑定为一体</li>\n<li><strong>自动重验证三触发</strong>：组件挂载、窗口聚焦、网络恢复时自动发起后台重验证，零配置保证数据新鲜度</li>\n<li><strong>请求去重窗口</strong>：<code>dedupingInterval</code>（默认 2000ms）内对同一 key 的多次调用只触发一次实际网络请求</li>\n<li><strong>中间件系统</strong>：通过 <code>use</code> 选项注入中间件增强 useSWR 行为，支持日志、认证、缓存持久化等扩展</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"核心设计哲学\">核心设计哲学</h2><p>SWR 的 API 设计遵循&quot;一个 hook 解决一个问题&quot;的原则。整个库的核心就是 <code>useSWR</code> 这一个 hook：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import useSWR from &#39;swr&#39;;&#10;&#10;const { data, error, isLoading, isValidating, mutate } = useSWR(&#10;  key, // 缓存键（通常是 URL）&#10;  fetcher, // 异步获取函数&#10;  options, // 可选配置&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> useSWR </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'swr'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">data</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">isLoading</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">isValidating</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">mutate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> useSWR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  key, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 缓存键（通常是 URL）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  fetcher, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 异步获取函数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  options, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 可选配置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>与 TanStack Query 的显著区别在于：SWR 的缓存键同时作为 fetcher 的参数传入——这种设计将&quot;描述要什么数据&quot;与&quot;如何获取数据&quot;自然绑定：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// key 自动传递给 fetcher&#10;const fetcher = (url: string) =&gt; fetch(url).then((r) =&gt; r.json());&#10;const { data } = useSWR(&#39;/api/users/1&#39;, fetcher);&#10;&#10;// 等价于&#10;fetcher(&#39;/api/users/1&#39;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// key 自动传递给 fetcher</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fetcher</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">url</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fetch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(url).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">then</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> r.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">json</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">data</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> useSWR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/api/users/1'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, fetcher);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 等价于</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">fetcher</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/api/users/1'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"缓存与重验证机制\">缓存与重验证机制</h2><p>SWR 的缓存实现基于全局 Map，以 key 的序列化值作为索引。重验证触发条件包括：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>触发条件</th>\n<th>配置项</th>\n<th>默认值</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>组件挂载</td>\n<td><code>revalidateOnMount</code></td>\n<td>true</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>窗口聚焦</td>\n<td><code>revalidateOnFocus</code></td>\n<td>true</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>网络恢复</td>\n<td><code>revalidateOnReconnect</code></td>\n<td>true</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>定时轮询</td>\n<td><code>refreshInterval</code></td>\n<td>0（禁用）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>手动触发</td>\n<td><code>mutate()</code></td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[Mount] --&gt; D[返回缓存]&#10;    B[Focus] --&gt; D&#10;    C[Reconnect] --&gt; D&#10;    D --&gt; E{数据过时?}&#10;    E --&gt;|是| F[后台 revalidate]&#10;    E --&gt;|否| G[不请求]&#10;    F --&gt; H[更新缓存 + 通知订阅者]\">flowchart LR\n    A[Mount] --&gt; D[返回缓存]\n    B[Focus] --&gt; D\n    C[Reconnect] --&gt; D\n    D --&gt; E{数据过时?}\n    E --&gt;|是| F[后台 revalidate]\n    E --&gt;|否| G[不请求]\n    F --&gt; H[更新缓存 + 通知订阅者]</pre><p>请求去重通过 <code>dedupingInterval</code>（默认 2000ms）实现——同一 key 在此窗口内的多次调用只触发一次实际网络请求。这对于多个组件依赖同一数据的场景至关重要。</p>\n<h2 id=\"条件请求与依赖获取\">条件请求与依赖获取</h2><p>SWR 通过传递 <code>null</code> 作为 key 来跳过请求：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 条件请求——userId 为空时不发请求&#10;const { data: user } = useSWR(userId ? `/api/users/${userId}` : null, fetcher);&#10;&#10;// 依赖获取——第二个请求等待第一个完成&#10;const { data: user } = useSWR(&#39;/api/me&#39;, fetcher);&#10;const { data: projects } = useSWR(user ? `/api/projects?org=${user.orgId}` : null, fetcher);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 条件请求——userId 为空时不发请求</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">data</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">user</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> useSWR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(userId </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `/api/users/${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">userId</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}`</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> :</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, fetcher);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 依赖获取——第二个请求等待第一个完成</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">data</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">user</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> useSWR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/api/me'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, fetcher);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">data</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">projects</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> useSWR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(user </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `/api/projects?org=${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">user</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">orgId</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}`</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> :</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, fetcher);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>函数式 key 在依赖不满足时抛出异常，SWR 会自动 catch 并暂停请求：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const { data } = useSWR(() =&gt; `/api/users/${userId}/posts?page=${page}`, fetcher);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">data</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> useSWR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `/api/users/${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">userId</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}/posts?page=${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">page</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, fetcher);</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"mutation-与乐观更新\">Mutation 与乐观更新</h2><p>SWR 的 <code>mutate</code> 函数既是本地更新入口，也是重验证触发器：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import useSWRMutation from &#39;swr/mutation&#39;;&#10;&#10;// 远程 mutation（v2.x 推荐方式）&#10;const { trigger, isMutating } = useSWRMutation(&#39;/api/todos&#39;, async (url, { arg }: { arg: NewTodo }) =&gt; {&#10;  return fetch(url, { method: &#39;POST&#39;, body: JSON.stringify(arg) }).then((r) =&gt; r.json());&#10;});&#10;&#10;// 乐观更新&#10;const addTodo = async (newTodo: NewTodo) =&gt; {&#10;  await mutate(&#10;    &#39;/api/todos&#39;,&#10;    async (currentData: Todo[]) =&gt; {&#10;      await trigger(newTodo); // 发送请求&#10;      return [...currentData, newTodo]; // 返回新数据&#10;    },&#10;    {&#10;      optimisticData: (current) =&gt; [...current, newTodo],&#10;      rollbackOnError: true, // 失败自动回滚&#10;      revalidate: false, // 不额外重验证&#10;    },&#10;  );&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> useSWRMutation </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'swr/mutation'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 远程 mutation（v2.x 推荐方式）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">trigger</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">isMutating</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> useSWRMutation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/api/todos'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">url</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">arg</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">arg</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> NewTodo</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0